elf and comparing so that you can  really fine-tune it but I wouldn't do  that at the beginning because you don't  want to reinforce any pronunciation  problems that you have at the beginning  if you let it go for a while after your  brain is more familiar with the sounds  you will probably do better so I don't  know if that's helpful I am sure there  are professional accent reduction people  who can give you better advice on  pronunciation but I was asked to do one  on pronunciation so there you have it  thanks for listening bye for now
 

